WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.430
Sunday morning.

2
00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.640
In one plain room, people sit in silence,

3
00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.630
usually for about an hour.

4
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:10.060
In a parish church, everyone
follows a set order,

5
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.880
with set words written down long ago.

6
00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:18.240
Across town, a band leads the songs,
and people clap and raise their hands.

7
00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:23.930
Silence, set words or a live band: why
do Christians worship in such different

8
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:24.950
ways?

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.980
In this mission, you'll
place Churches on a line,

10
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.900
from set words to no set words at all.

11
00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:35.050
Then you'll weigh up whether liturgical
worship is the best way for Christians

12
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.200
to worship.

13
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.670
Your mission: find out why Christians
worship in such different ways.
